                                              (PrimeFactorUnimodality.primesBelow (N + 1)) r)) ∧
                                      (K * Real.log ↑N <
                                          PrimeFactorOscillations.nicolasPrimeProductClock ↑N -
                                            Real.exp (Real.exp (L - Real.eulerMascheroniConstant)) →
